flow: et2 — Create simulation flow
direction: LR

[start] prompt: Operator NL prompt in agent chat
[process] resolve: Agent resolves nearest variant recipe
  { icon: "GitBranch", color: "amber" }
[decision] confirm: Ambiguous match?
  { icon: "HelpCircle", color: "amber" }
[process] generate: MCP generates .et2/projects/<id>/
  { icon: "FolderPlus", color: "blue" }
[process] build: pio run + wokwi-cli validation
  { icon: "Hammer", color: "violet" }
[end] deliver: Sim URL + ZIP + import steps

prompt ==> resolve
resolve -> confirm
confirm ->|Yes, wait| generate
confirm ->|Clear match| generate
generate ==> build
build ==> deliver
